{"type":"table","attrs":{"isNumberColumnEnabled":false,"layout":"center","localId":"54d652da-c96b-469e-b55a-554e2b1149fe"},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"インシデント番号"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MFTBCFFR-5756"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"説明"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"UV FDP中国 在庫加修の整備原価が２つの内１つが反映していない"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"rowspan":4},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"RCA"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本件について調査した結果、見積「2-BMOQHY」のMF Repair Fee金額に、JC「I050756954」に関連するSV原価 439,201円が含まれていないことを確認しました。"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【車両情報】"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"項目"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"値"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VINFK61F-587225"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"見積番号"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2-BMOQHY"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"受注番号"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"E050788533"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【関連レコード】","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"JC 番号"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"UV BB PO Flag"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SV原価（円）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I050662915Y22,870I050756954N439,201"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"調査の結果、以下を確認しました。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"・JC「I050662915」はUV BB PO Flagが「Y」であったため、SV原価22,870円が正常にUV 在庫のRepair Fee金額へ反映されました。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"・JC「I050756954」はUV BB PO Flagが「N」であったため、通常の業務フローでは見積承認を実施できない状態でした。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"・そのため、リカバリーSR「MFTBCFFR-5669」が起票され、リカバリー対応により見積ステータスを「Customer Approved」へ更新しました。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"・UV InventoryのRepair Fee金額を更新する処理では、所定の条件を満たすレコードのみを対象としています。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---＞ JC「I050756954」はUV BB PO Flagが「N」であったため、Repair Fee更新処理の対象条件を満たさず、SV原価439,201円はUV 在庫のRepair Fee金額へ反映されませんでした。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"その結果、MF Repair Feeの計算にはJC「I050662915」のSV原価22,870円のみが含まれ、JC「I050756954」のSV原価439,201円は含まれませんでした。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"これにより、MF Repair Fee金額が本来の想定よりも低い金額となっていました。"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"リカバリー状況"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完了済"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"修正プラン"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"NA"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"UAT予定日"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"NA"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"次回更新"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"業務側からのご回答に応じて更新いたします。"}]}]}]}]}
{adf}

 

何かご不明な点がございましたらご連絡ください。

宜しくお願い致します。

 

(English)

 

Thank you for your support

{adf:display=block}
{"type":"table","attrs":{"isNumberColumnEnabled":false,"layout":"center","localId":"4b2b9681-5976-4771-b407-e7928353ee56"},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Incident Number"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MFTBCFFR-5756"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"UV FDP中国 在庫加修の整備原価が２つの内１つが反映していない"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"rowspan":4},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Root Cause (RCA)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We have reviewed the issue on our end and identified the following:"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SV cost of 439,201 JPY related to JC I050756954 was not included in the MF Repair Fee amount in Quote 2-BMOQHY."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We have reviewed the issue on our end and identified the following:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vehicle Information","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ItemValueVINFK61F-587225Quote No.2-BMOQHYSO No.E050788533"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Related Records","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"JC No.UV BB PO FlagSV Cost (JPY)I050662915Y22,870I050756954N439,201"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We found that:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"JC I050662915 had the UV BB PO Flag set to "},{"type":"text","text":"'Y'","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":", therefore the SV cost of"},{"type":"text","text":"22,870 JPY","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was successfully added to the Repair Fee amount in UV Inventory."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"JC I050756954 had the UV BB PO Flag set to "},{"type":"text","text":"'N'","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Because of this, the user was unable to approve the quote through the normal process."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"To resolve this issue, "},{"type":"text","text":"Recovery JIRA MFTBCFFR-5669","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was raised and the quote status was updated to "},{"type":"text","text":"Customer Approved","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through the recovery process."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The logic that updates the Repair Fee amount in UV Inventory considers only records that meet the required criteria. Since the "},{"type":"text","text":"UV BB PO Flag value was 'N'","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":", JC I050756954 did not meet the selection criteria used for updating the Repair Fee amount."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"As a result, the SV cost of "},{"type":"text","text":"439,201 JPY","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" related to JC I050756954 was not added to the Repair Fee amount in UV Inventory and was therefore not included in the MF Repair Fee calculation."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"As a result, only the SV cost of "},{"type":"text","text":"22,870 JPY","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" related to JC I050662915 was included in the Repair Fee calculation, causing the MF Repair Fee amount to be lower than expected."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Kindly let us know if you have any further questions."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Recovery status"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Recovery completed"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fix Plan"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"NA"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Planned UAT date"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"NA"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next update"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on Biz feedback"}]}]}]}]}
{adf}

If you have any query, please let us know.

 

Best Regards,
Shubham Agarwal

